e the duplicate delivery\"},\n        {\"owner\": \"Bob\", \"action\": \"will verify the recovery test tomorrow\"},\n        {\"owner\": null, \"action\": \"do not enable automatic tool retries when the execution result is unknown\"},\n        {\"owner\": \"release owner\", \"action\": \"will collect the test evidence before making a decision\"}\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src_9ae9904817e147b393858f300e226077ec6818db2ccdd44fb5478f6f45e58cfc\",\n        \"src_21b97b0e684b93f712838cd9dd8f970325839814bd3005511adef4a7f62f4428\",\n        \"src_3d586acf69d61610a5aceee0328ac8a72bb4f5d6d8ad3119c91ed49dd8a1a569\",\n        \"src_5e87c81a44e3c84cc6b27900d3ceb492a5535d92482a1fc07ad1d012c4ec25df\",\n        \"src_92d6d9258c0cf2b8dec067ebefa04f4f24a79798b4e45802b31532ff0d5acaa5\",\n        \"src_430d6e5aa6707171e11529abc8683e989f8f6573802f34d3b26d7847ffe6d28a\",\n        \"src_5bc1f6e8cda9f95565805109c55799f388b4acde9528803959a6041daa82b537\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"decision_code\": \"Silver Lantern\",\n      \"owner\": \"Alice\",\n      \"title\": \"QBAF/QBAC pressure review for failure recovery\",\n      \"description\": \"Checkpoint 1 (audio 0–4620 ms) assigns the codename Silver Lantern and hands ownership of QBAC Pressure Review to Alice; no test evidence has been recorded in the room.\",\n      \"steps\": [\n        \"Re-read the Checkpoint 1 segment to confirm the review scope before starting.\",\n        \"Draft the QBAC Pressure Review checklist covering failure-recovery retry and acknowledgement semantics.\",\n        \"Record review findings and hand them to the release owner as test evidence.\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src_a4d208d35f7d0e1ee2093642fc6114543a4471110652bbf618b4c20b1fd2b98d\",\n        \"src_96f730d1371eeee61a2647ca7e598467eb9be2fc34ca66069d2958c01b0ea7fb\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"decision_code\": \"Cobalt Bridge\",\n      \"owner\": \"Bob\",\n      \"title\": \"Write the data